{"id":"en_campus-queen-dropped-her-act","title":"Campus Queen Dropped Her Act","titleEn":"Campus Queen Dropped Her Act","description":"For three years, Josie Zouch had played the part of a devoted admirer to Zack Lever, the most sought-after guy on campus, tending to his every whim. Her patience ran out on New Year's Eve, when he humiliated her once more as she confessed her feelings; she simply said \"Game over\" and left. What Zack never knew was that Josie belonged to the wealthy Zouch family and had been living as a slum girl to settle a wager with her childhood friend Sean Gaunt. Once the bet concluded, she stepped back into her true identity and cut ties with Zack. Learning the truth too late, Zack was filled with regret and, alongside a jealous Willa Shears, schemed to sabotage Josie and Sean's wedding, only to be beaten and disgraced. Those who want to follow this series can do so on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/campus-queen-dropped-her-act/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/campus-queen-dropped-her-act/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Secret Identity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djp9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_campus-queen-dropped-her-act_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djp9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_campus-queen-dropped-her-act_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7djp9k/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_campus-queen-dropped-her-act_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","ur